msgid "Used for connections not matched by a routing rule. The value in parentheses comes from the selected profile; if no final outbound is specified, its first outbound is used. Explicit routing rules still take precedence."
msgstr "用于未匹配路由规则的连接。括号内显示所选配置的默认出站；配置未指定默认出站时，使用第一个出站。明确匹配的路由规则仍优先生效。"

msgid "Resolves domain names used by outbound connections, including proxy server addresses. The value in parentheses is the profile resolver tag, not the default DNS server for LAN queries. Individual outbounds may specify their own resolver. Not specified means no profile-wide resolver is configured."
msgstr "用于解析出站连接使用的域名，包括代理服务器地址。括号内是配置中的解析器标记，不是局域网 DNS 查询的默认服务器。各出站可以指定自己的解析器。“未指定”表示配置没有统一设置默认解析器。"

msgid "Controls UDP mappings in the core, not the router firewall NAT. Endpoint independent reuses one mapping for all destinations; address dependent separates destinations by IP; address and port dependent separates them by IP and port. The default is endpoint independent."
msgstr "控制核心内部的 UDP 映射，不修改路由器防火墙 NAT。端点独立：访问不同目标时复用映射；地址相关：按目标 IP 分别建立映射；地址和端口相关：按目标 IP 和端口分别建立映射。默认为端点独立。"

msgid "Controls which replies the core accepts for a UDP mapping. Endpoint independent accepts any remote endpoint; address dependent accepts IPs already contacted; address and port dependent accepts only IP and port pairs already contacted. This does not enable UDP support on a proxy node."
msgstr "控制核心为 UDP 映射接收哪些回包。端点独立：接受任意远端；地址相关：只接受已发送过数据的远端 IP；地址和端口相关：只接受已发送过数据的远端 IP 与端口组合。此选项不能让不支持 UDP 的代理节点获得 UDP 能力。"

msgid "Maximum UDP NAT sessions maintained by the core. When full, the least recently used session is closed. Empty or 0 lets sing-box choose a limit based on system memory; this does not change the router connection-tracking limit."
msgstr "核心维护的 UDP NAT 会话数量上限。达到上限时关闭最久未使用的会话。留空或填写 0 时由 sing-box 根据系统内存自动选择；不修改路由器的连接跟踪数量上限。"

msgid "Idle time in seconds before a UDP NAT session expires. Empty uses the core default of 300 seconds. This is not a connection-test timeout."
msgstr "UDP NAT 会话空闲多久后回收，单位为秒。留空使用核心默认值 300 秒。这不是连接检查的超时时间。"

